UID:SVqSg97qcF
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 112 mins (1h52m)\n\nSingle mother Sofie starts a new
  career as a caretaker for the elderly\, only to be humbled by the toll it
  takes on her physical and mental state\, in this authentic and rewarding 
 glimpse at the uncelebrated world of healthcare workers from SIFF alum Fre
 lle Petersen. Director Frelle Petersen and actor Jette Søndergaard schedu
 led to attend. Sponsored by:\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/home-sweet-h
 ome\n\nAlso playing at:\n  • AMC Pacific Place 11 (Wed 21 May\, 3:30 PM)
LOCATION:AMC Pacific Place 11\, 600 Pine Street
END:VEVENT
